  "body": "Byte sequence **starts with** https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#byte-sequence-starts-with has a step (2.3 \"If aByte is null, then return true\") that results in treating certain shorter sequences as starting with certain longer sequences, e.g. `abc` starting with `abcd`, while really it's vice versa.\r\n\r\nString **code unit prefix** https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-unit-prefix, being essentialy the same algorithm, has the same problem.",
